Gershwin components
===================

url    = https://github.com/gershwin-desktop/gershwin-components.git
tag    = 26.09
commit = 08ca92248d35115c15d7060567ae2000a9222e10
date   = 2026-09-17

Only Menu and the SoundBackend and NetworkBackend libraries it links
with are built, by tools/desktop/build-menu.sh, which foxyn-desktop(8)
runs on the desktop image (tools/linux/build.sh desktop). It downloads
this revision's archive, checks its SHA-256 and applies three DragonFly
patches to Menu (docs/desktop-menu.md). The other components are not
built yet, and none is part of buildworld. Keep build output outside the
submodule. When upgrading, update the revision and checksum in
build-menu.sh too.
License: BSD 2-Clause text in LICENSE and additional notices in subprojects. Complete provenance review and preserve applicable notices
and source obligations before distributing selected components.
On upgrade, review dependencies, ABI, installation paths and desktop tests.
